%% Phase3 / channel_member / MV3-G09d 成员快照读取
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/channel_member/mv3-g09d/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::queryMembersSnapshot；src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::getChannelMembersByIds
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员打开加急弹窗、未读成员列表或 @ 候选名单时，看到该会话的完整成员，而不是空列表或「消息数据异常」。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: loadChannelIncrement(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 组装频道成员全集快照 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http 频道增量快照（含 members）；旧 POST /channels/member/byIds 已合并
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel_member + channel + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（channelIncrement，INCREMENT_CHANNEL，im:channel:increment）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：快照 userIds === (owner + boss + members + adminUsers) 去重后的集合，且顺序与 channel.members 位序一致（MV3-G06d readBits 位序依赖）；命中频道时返回的 DialogItem 自带 members（length 大于 0 的群不得返回空 members），memberCount === members.length
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：startTime 必须为 0：若用 channel.createAt 作过滤起点，createAt 早于频道创建时间的历史消息会把快照过滤成空 → allMembers=[] → 加急弹窗报「消息数据异常」；成员变更（MV3-G09a/G09b/G09c）后不得沿用旧快照：queryMembersSnapshot 必须重算，命中旧缓存视为契约破损
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelIncrement，INCREMENT_CHANNEL，im:channel:increment；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
